     1055   PROCEDURE adm-update-record :
     1056       MESSAGE
     1057         "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1058           "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Update.":U
     1059             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
