     1178   PROCEDURE use-initial-lock :
     1179     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-attr-value AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1180     ASSIGN adm-initial-lock = p-attr-value.
     1181     RETURN.
     1182   END PROCEDURE.
     1183     RUN set-attribute-list ('FIELDS-ENABLED=no,ADM-NEW-RECORD=no':U).
